---

<section
  id="df-services"
  class="df-section">
  <div class="df-section-head">
    <div>
      <p class="df-kicker">Nuestras especialidades</p><h2>
        Cuidamos tu sonrisa<br />en cada etapa.
      </h2>
    </div><p>Conocé las áreas de atención de nuestro consultorio.</p>
  </div><div class="df-services">
    <article class="df-service">
      <span class="df-service-label">Infancias</span><h3>Odontopediatría</h3><p>
        Od. Natalia Borlando
      </p>
    </article>
    <article class="df-service">
      <span class="df-service-label">Desarrollo</span><h3>
        Ortopedia maxilar
      </h3><p>Od. Natalia Borlando</p>
    </article>
    <article class="df-service">
      <span class="df-service-label">Cuidado integral</span><h3>
        Odontología general
      </h3><p>Od. José Manuel Ispizua</p>
    </article>
    <article class="df-service">
      <span class="df-service-label">Rehabilitación</span><h3>Implantes</h3><p>
        Od. José Manuel Ispizua
      </p>
    </article>
    <article class="df-service">
      <span class="df-service-label">Alineación dental</span><h3>
        Ortodoncia
      </h3><p>Od. José Manuel Ispizua</p>
    </article>
    <p class="df-services-note">
      Consultanos por WhatsApp para conversar sobre tu consulta y coordinar un
      turno.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  :global(.df-section-head) {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: end;
    gap: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  :global(.df-section-head p) {
    max-width: 290px;
    color: #47576d;
  }
  :global(.df-services) {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0 28px;
  }
  :global(.df-service) {
    border-top: 1px solid #cbd8df;
    padding: 24px 0 26px;
  }
  :global(.df-service .df-service-label) {
    color: #17665e;
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    display: block;
  }
  :global(.df-service h3) {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  :global(.df-service p) {
    color: #47576d;
    font-size: 16px;
  }
  :global(.df-services-note) {
    grid-column: 1/-1;
    border-top: 1px solid #cbd8df;
    padding-top: 18px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #47576d;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    :global(.df-services) {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
    :global(.df-section-head) {
      align-items: start;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    :global(.df-section-head) {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 26px;
    }
    :global(.df-section-head p) {
      margin-top: 18px;
      max-width: none;
    }
    :global(.df-services) {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    :global(.df-service) {
      padding-block: 23px;
    }
  }
</style>
